# 심사 메모
s=open('store/review_notes_1131.txt',encoding='utf-8').read();i=s.index("What's new in 1.1.31:");j=s.index('The Christmas season content is unchanged')
new="""What's new in 1.1.32:
(1) No new purchases, accounts, permissions or SDKs.
(2) Thank-you gift for 200 downloads: players who already used the app before updating receive a one-time in-game gift (10,000 in-game pearls and 500 in-game gems, until December 31). In-game currency only; no real money.
(3) Arena (online): a few seconds of spawn protection right after joining.
(4) Town: performance improvements for large towns, offline production fix, and more robust save loading.
(5) Friends: players can send a small amount of in-game pearls to a friend's public aquarium (up to 1,000 per day) and search public aquariums by nickname. No chat or personal data; only the nickname the player chose.
(6) The per-run in-game pearl limit in Solo and Deep Expedition was removed; layout fixes on small screens and translation fixes.
"""
open('store/review_notes_1132.txt','w',encoding='utf-8').write(s[:i]+new+s[j:])
